        <div class="craftmix-lovers-list-item-card">
          <img class="craftmix-lovers-list-item-card-stars" src="{{ 'yellow-stars.png' | asset_url }}" width="150" height="29" alt="Stars" role="presentation" loading="lazy">
          <p class="craftmix-lovers-list-item-card-text"> I was very pleased with the taste. Easy to mix. I would recommend to anyone. I plan to order more.</p>
